          "guid": "mt5mhth1l0s8deqp",
          "message": {
            "text": "Every nondegenerate repeating domain now moves and normalizes the SVG vector; coincident stops collapse to Blink's final solid color. Focused DPR1/2 Chromium tests cover negative, over-line, zoomed, coincident, and omitted domains with zero logical-interior mismatches and a repeat-removal mutation, while the formerly relaxed feature is 0.00% clean.",
            "markdown": "Every nondegenerate repeating domain now moves and normalizes the SVG vector; coincident stops collapse to Blink's final solid color. Focused DPR1/2 Chromium tests cover negative, over-line, zoomed, coincident, and omitted domains with zero logical-interior mismatches and a repeat-removal mutation, while the formerly relaxed feature is 0.00% clean."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/gradient-defs.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 177,
                  "endLine": 195,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  let vx1 = x1, vy1 = y1, vx2 = x2, vy2 = y2;\n  let emitStops = stops;\n  if (repeating && stops.length >= 2) {\n    const first = stops[0].pos;\n    const last = stops[stops.length - 1].pos;\n    const period = last - first;\n    if (period > Number.EPSILON) {\n      vx1 = x1 + first * (x2 - x1);\n      vy1 = y1 + first * (y2 - y1);\n      vx2 = x1 + last * (x2 - x1);\n      vy2 = y1 + last * (y2 - y1);\n      emitStops = stops.map((s) => ({ ...s, pos: (s.pos - first) / period }));\n    } else {\n      const final = stops[stops.length - 1];\n      emitStops = [{ ...final, pos: 0 }, { ...final, pos: 1 }];\n      repeating = false;\n    }\n  }\n"
                  }
